	)
	(text "Hold BOOT while tapping RESET to force USB download mode. GPIO35-37 are only free on quad-PSRAM modules\n(N16R2 / N8R2 / no PSRAM); on an N16R8 module they are used internally - leave those header pins unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "696ad4b1-5a60-4576-b4d8-b7018dc3be5d")
	)
	(text "Read: RFID_CARRIER = 125 kHz square wave (LEDC). The emitter follower Q5/Q6 drives the series tank\n(C22 4.7 nF + 345 uH coil = 125 kHz). D7, C23 and R24 detect the envelope, so the tag's load\nmodulation appears after C24 and is sliced by comparator U7 into RFID_DATA (Manchester / biphase,\ndecode in firmware). R26 biases the signal to VREF = 1.65 V, R27 adds hysteresis.\nEmulate: hold RFID_CARRIER low and key RFID_MOD (Q7 loads the coil through D8).\nWriting T5577: gate the carrier on and off from firmware.\nValues are a starting point - trim C22 for maximum amplitude at the coil."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.28 320.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "763a3e81-d458-411d-9695-69fbfd6b8c74")
	)
	(text "NFC 13.56 MHz  -  PN532 MODULE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 367.54 167.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7b859731-f597-400d-a8b4-5708c45b26c3")
	)
	(text "iBUTTON (1-Wire)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
