		(uuid "9ba5c901-f3df-48a6-9dac-106812f8c529")
	)
	(text "5V pin = USB VBUS: only live while USB is plugged in.\nGPIO3, GPIO45, GPIO46 are ESP32-S3 strapping pins:\nexternal hardware must not drive them during reset\n(GPIO45/46 must stay low).\nSPI and I2C are the shared on-board buses; use GPIO3\nor GPIO35-37 as chip-select for an external SPI device."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 516.89 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a1fadfbb-7cb2-4222-8d4d-06a31d6cf465")
	)
	(text "Module pinout: 1 GND 2 VCC 3 GDO0 4 CSN 5 SCK\n6 MOSI 7 MISO 8 GDO2. A module is tuned for one\nband (433 or 868/915 MHz) - buy the one that is\nlegal in your country."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
